                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr. Russell.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-05-20"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis informs Mr. Russell that Mr. Frank Plumley has been appointed umpire
                    for the British and Dutch commissions, and instructs him to convey this
                    information to the Venezuelan Govern-</p>
